{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32884","headline":"冬至後西湖泛舟看断冰偶成长句 · 李郢","name":"冬至後西湖泛舟看断冰偶成长句","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一阳生後阴飙竭，湖上层冰看折时。\n云母扇摇当殿色，珊瑚树碎满盘枝。\n斜汀藻动鱼应觉，极浦波生鴈未知。\n山影浅中留瓦砾，日光寒外送涟漪。\n崖崩苇岸纵横散，篙蹙兰舟片段随。\n曾向黄河望冲激，大鹏飞起雪风吹。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李郢","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32884.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32884","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}